@OrdersProcessor.Service_HostAddress = https://localhost:7072

# Test the Orders Processor Service API

### Check service health
GET {{OrdersProcessor.Service_HostAddress}}/api/orderprocessor/health

### Get current order statistics
GET {{OrdersProcessor.Service_HostAddress}}/api/orderprocessor/statistics

### Get orders eligible for status updates
GET {{OrdersProcessor.Service_HostAddress}}/api/orderprocessor/eligible-orders

### Manually trigger order processing (for testing)
POST {{OrdersProcessor.Service_HostAddress}}/api/orderprocessor/process-now

